00171: {"id":"CORE-C0171","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[301,301],"text":"- 结果解码按包装分列：野生包装只对 2（负）/5（平）返回假，对 3（逃/弃权）/4（捕获）返回真；训练家包装只对 1（胜）返回真，3/4/5 均为假。野生覆写截断时直接返回钩子值，不经过普通结果归一。","facts":["CORE-F015","CORE-F017","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00172: {"id":"CORE-C0172","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[302,302],"text":"- 未运行确认：开场动画、消息顺序帧、伙伴实际编队、调试跳过均未运行验证。","facts":["CORE-F015","CORE-F017","CORE-F055","CORE-F056"]}
00173: {"id":"CORE-C0173","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[306,306],"text":"| 配置/数据 | 当前默认 | 影响 |","facts":["CORE-F059"]}
00174: {"id":"CORE-C0174","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[308,308],"text":"| OVERWORLD_WEATHER_SETS_BATTLE_TERRAIN | 世代 ≥ 8 开（当前以配置复核） | 世界天气 → 战斗地形（仅 Storm/Fog） |","facts":["CORE-F059"]}
00175: {"id":"CORE-C0175","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[309,309],"text":"| NEW_CAPTURE_CAN_REPLACE_PARTY_MEMBER | 开 | 满队捕获询问；forceCatchIntoParty 覆盖为总是入队 |","facts":["CORE-F059"]}
00176: {"id":"CORE-C0176","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[310,310],"text":"| TIME_SHADING | 开 | 战斗时段取值（WP59） |","facts":["CORE-F059"]}
00177: {"id":"CORE-C0177","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[311,311],"text":"| MAX_PARTY_SIZE | 6 | 对视合并「可储存」上限判断 |","facts":["CORE-F059"]}
00178: {"id":"CORE-C0178","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[312,312],"text":"| CHECK_EVOLUTION_AFTER_ALL_BATTLES / CHECK_EVOLUTION_FOR_FAINTED_POKEMON | 按配置 | 善后进化检查 |","facts":["CORE-F059"]}
