00180: {"id":"CORE-C0180","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[314,314],"text":"| GAIN_EXP_FOR_CAPTURE | 开 | 捕获后胜利界面（界面归 WP67-A） |","facts":["CORE-F059"]}
00181: {"id":"CORE-C0181","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[315,315],"text":"| 系统设置 | 对战风格/战斗动画/发送盒子 | 规则优先、否则读系统 |","facts":["CORE-F059"]}
00182: {"id":"CORE-C0182","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[316,316],"text":"| 伙伴 | 全局伙伴字段（WP24 写） | 参与资格与编队 |","facts":["CORE-F059"]}
00183: {"id":"CORE-C0183","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[318,318],"text":"未验证组合：多人（≥ 3 训练家）实测、伙伴+多对手组合、设施规则（条款）组合、调试中止、真实动画资源。","facts":["CORE-F059"]}
00184: {"id":"CORE-C0184","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[322,322],"text":"示例场景31条见 `../test-catalog/combat-requirements-wp39-40-41-42-45.md` 的 BC 系列（BC-01～BC-31），覆盖：野生单次构造与输入形式两态、训练家合并复用/探测未保存、跳过生成时点两入口、野生覆写截断、野生结果归一、两包装结果 3/5 对照、跳过无成员/DEBUG、伙伴对手单个/两个、尺寸缩减训练家/野生两例、尺寸拒绝、野生同步、业主映射、对面取序 3v2 核对点，以及存活偏好的原始查询、存活/缺席对照和捕获补救目标分层。","facts":[]}
00185: {"id":"CORE-C0185","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[326,326],"text":"- 上游：WP20（招式槽/静默学习）、WP24（玩家/训练家/伙伴）、WP25（队伍容量/成员流转）、WP11（地图拓扑与转移）、WP02（配置）；引用 WP59（时间/天气输入）、WP36（普通遭遇请求与交接合同）、WP12（地形标签）。","facts":[]}
00186: {"id":"CORE-C0186","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[327,327],"text":"- 下游：WP40（命令/顺序）、WP41（换人/位置/逃跑）、WP42（回合末/终局）、WP45（战斗天气）、WP38（捕获）、WP37/WP53（漫游/特殊模式）、WP54–WP58（设施条款）、WP62（图鉴）。","facts":[]}
00187: {"id":"CORE-C0187","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[331,331],"text":"1. 4 席以上布局（源注释明示需改代码）——不列为支持。","facts":[]}
00188: {"id":"CORE-C0188","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[332,332],"text":"2. 对视合并中「待战登记未消费」的真实事件编排后果（需要事件侧证据，U01）。","facts":[]}
00189: {"id":"CORE-C0189","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[333,333],"text":"3. 条款规则的完整设施语义（WP54–WP58）；本规格只登记键名与消费。","facts":[]}
00190: {"id":"CORE-C0190","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[334,334],"text":"4. 多人（3 训练家）实测动画与消息；伙伴编队在缺员时的实际取舍（静态已给规则，未运行）。","facts":[]}
00191: {"id":"CORE-C0191","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp39-battle-context-and-participants.md","range":[335,335],"text":"5. 全部内容无运行确认；未运行任何真实战斗、开场动画或输入。","facts":[]}
00192: {"id":"CORE-C0192","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[3,3],"text":"分类：combat-requirements（选择 → 登记 → 执行的条件与次序）；性质：实现独立行为合同。","facts":[]}
00193: {"id":"CORE-C0193","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[5,5],"text":"本规格为净化正文：按统一交接将批准输入 WP40《命令、特殊行动、服从性与行动顺序》转写为独立行为文字，不含源文件路径、类名、行号与证据 URL（参考与已读集中登记于 `../../audit/source-traceability.md` 批次 10 条目）。文中保留的字段名、配置键与数据身份名均为数据标识，不构成未来实现的数据结构或接口模板。全部内容为静态证据；**无运行确认**（见 `../scope-statement.md`）。","facts":[]}
00194: {"id":"CORE-C0194","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[13,13],"text":"定义一个战斗回合从「谁选什么」到「谁真正执行、按什么顺序执行」的完整要求：命令目录与控制权；选择、合法性与登记；撤销/重选；执行前复检与执行反馈；PP、物品库存与目标的检查写入分层；服从性与 AI 选择分离；优先级、速度与队列重排；Mega/Primal 的战斗侧资格与时机；Call 与 Shift 的选择语义。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F029","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F039","CORE-F040","CORE-F041","CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00195: {"id":"CORE-C0195","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[17,17],"text":"1. 命令阶段（目录、控制权、循环、撤销/重选、占满回合规则）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F029","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F039","CORE-F040","CORE-F041","CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00196: {"id":"CORE-C0196","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[18,18],"text":"2. 选择期合法性（招式可否选择的原因族；物品战斗使用分层；目标合法性；登记写入）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F029","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F039","CORE-F040","CORE-F041","CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00197: {"id":"CORE-C0197","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[19,19],"text":"3. 攻击阶段（阶段顺序、执行前复检、使用招式的完整检查序、失败前后消耗）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F029","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F039","CORE-F040","CORE-F041","CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00198: {"id":"CORE-C0198","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[20,20],"text":"4. 服从性（整数门与不服从分支）与 AI 分离。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F029","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F039","CORE-F040","CORE-F041","CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00199: {"id":"CORE-C0199","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[21,21],"text":"5. 行动顺序（优先级、子优先级、速度、平局、重算与重排）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F029","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F039","CORE-F040","CORE-F041","CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00200: {"id":"CORE-C0200","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[22,22],"text":"6. Mega/Primal 战斗侧资格与时机；Call/Shift 的选择语义。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F029","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F039","CORE-F040","CORE-F041","CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00201: {"id":"CORE-C0201","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[26,26],"text":"- 不定义招式效果值、伤害公式、命中公式细节（WP43）、效果族（WP44–WP50）、特性/道具修正族（WP48/WP50）、AI 评分（WP51/52）、换人执行与位置变更结果（WP41）、回合末与终局（WP42）、捕获公式与接收（WP38）、个体 Mega/Primal 完整域（WP22）、Shadow 完整生命周期（WP23）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F029","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F039","CORE-F040","CORE-F041","CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00202: {"id":"CORE-C0202","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[27,27],"text":"- 不定义界面演出（WP67-A）。","facts":["CORE-F027","CORE-F028","CORE-F029","CORE-F035","CORE-F036","CORE-F037","CORE-F038","CORE-F039","CORE-F040","CORE-F041","CORE-F042","CORE-F043","CORE-F044"]}
00203: {"id":"CORE-C0203","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[33,33],"text":"| 术语 | 定义 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F029","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00204: {"id":"CORE-C0204","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[35,35],"text":"| 选择（choice） | 每席位的行动决定，包含动作类型、该动作需要的招式/物品/替补身份及目标；排序还会确定供后续资格检查读取的招式优先级。动作身份 ∈ {None, UseMove, SwitchOut, UseItem, Call, Run, Shift}；不规定字段数量、固定槽位或容器表示。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F029","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00205: {"id":"CORE-C0205","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[36,36],"text":"| 控制权 | 玩家拥有的席位由玩家选择；AI 席位与「玩家侧 AI 控制」模式下由 AI 选择（本规格只调用 AI 接口，不定义其策略）。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F029","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00206: {"id":"CORE-C0206","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[37,37],"text":"| 登记 | 把选择写入选择槽的动作；登记 ≠ 执行——执行期按 §8 第 2 条的分族合同处理，换人执行不重新调用组合检查（WP41）。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F029","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00207: {"id":"CORE-C0207","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[38,38],"text":"| 占满回合 | 某些选择（逃跑、投球）一经确认，本回合不再为其余席位选择，（对逃跑）且阻止继续选择。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F029","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00208: {"id":"CORE-C0208","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[39,39],"text":"| 强制动作 | 多回合招式中途、已被动作锁定的席位等——命令不可选，直接沿用。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F029","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00209: {"id":"CORE-C0209","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[40,40],"text":"| 子优先级 | 同一招式优先级内的「最先/最后」微调（特性/道具）。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F029","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
00210: {"id":"CORE-C0210","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp40-commands-obedience-and-action-order.md","range":[41,41],"text":"| 不服从 | 玩家拥有的高等级个体在服从门命中时改用其它动作/动作失效的规则族。 |","facts":["CORE-F001","CORE-F029","CORE-F040","CORE-F041"]}
